{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"mana_crystal_node","model_identifier":"mana_crystal_node","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# mana_crystal_node\n\nMana crystal node: five to seven tall thin cyan crystals rising from black volcanic rock. Crystals are `glow_*` cubes; the depleted look leaves only stubs.\n\n- Bounds (first set): x -31..28, y 0..58, z -21..20 units (1.66 x 1.62 x 1.15 m). Origin at the base centre, front faces -Z.\n- Texture: 128 x 128, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering; every visible face has its own region painted with its material at world position (identical faces share one). No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: 28.\n\n## Hit box\n\n- 59 x 58 x 41 (w x h x d), centred at x -2, z -0\n\n## State group sets (children of `root`; show exactly one)\n\n- `full` (visible by default): untouched node\n- `depleted`: mined out: smaller broken chunks and gravel\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | what moves |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `hit` | 0.3 | once | short shake when struck (both sets) |\n\n- Glowing cubes (`glow_*`): glow_crystal0, glow_crystal0_tip, glow_crystal1, glow_crystal1_tip, glow_crystal2, glow_crystal2_tip, glow_crystal3, glow_crystal3_tip, glow_crystal4, glow_crystal4_tip, glow_crystal5, glow_crystal5_tip ...\n"},"resolution":{"width":128,"height":128},"elements":[{"name":"rock0","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-22.0,0.0,-19.0],"to":[22.0,10.0,19.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[0.0,74.0,44.0,84.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[44.0,74.0,82.0,84.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[0.0,74.0,44.0,84.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[44.0,74.0,82.0,84.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[6.0,0.0,50.0,38.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[6.0,0.0,50.0