128 x 128, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering; every visible face has its own region painted with its material at world position (identical faces share one). No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: 28.\n\n## Hit box\n\n- 59 x 58 x 41 (w x h x d), centred at x -2, z -0\n\n## State group sets (children of `root`; show exactly one)\n\n- `full` (visible by default): untouched node\n- `depleted`: mined out: smaller broken chunks and gravel\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | what moves |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `hit` | 0.3 | once | short shake when struck (both sets) |\n\n- Glowing cubes (`glow_*`): glow_crystal0, glow_crystal0_tip, glow_crystal1, glow_crystal1_tip, glow_crystal2, glow_crystal2_tip, glow_crystal3, glow_crystal3_tip, glow_crystal4, glow_crystal4_tip, glow_crystal5, glow_crystal5_tip ...\n"}